    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="46.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 46.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hit ðeowman gedó, ðolie his hyde oððe hydgyldes, be ðam ðe seo dæd sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a slave does so, he shall undergo the lash or pay the fine in lieu thereof, in accordance with the nature of the deed.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit ðeowman gedó, þolige his hyde oððe hydgyldes, be þam þe seo dæd sy.</ab>
      </div>
